================================================================================
ICON ACCESSIBILITY
================================================================================

Statistics already contain visible labels:

Total Items

Purchased

Remaining Items

Total Cost


Therefore Bootstrap Icons are decorative:

aria-hidden="true"


They reinforce the visible label but do not provide the only meaning.


================================================================================
PROGRESS BAR ACCESSIBILITY
================================================================================

Visual CSS:

width:
`${stats.percentageComplete}%`


Accessibility:

role="progressbar"

aria-valuemin="0"

aria-valuemax="100"

aria-valuenow={
  stats.percentageComplete
}


Thus the progress value is not communicated only through:

bar width

or:

color


