PART 7: REAL-TIME STAT UPDATES
================================================================================

"REAL-TIME" IN THIS LESSON
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

There is no server stream, WebSocket, polling, or background process.

Here, "real-time" simply means:

THE DISPLAY REACTS IMMEDIATELY
TO THE CURRENT LOCAL REACT STATE.


================================================================================
TOGGLE FLOW
================================================================================

User checks Milk
      ↓
handleToggleBought()
      ↓
groceryItems changes
      ↓
App renders
      ↓
calculateStats(
  groceryItems
)
      ↓
New stats
      ↓
Footer receives stats
      ↓
Footer renders new values


================================================================================
